{
  "$schema": "../schema/component.schema.json",
  "id": "colourful-text",
  "title": "彩色文字",
  "description": "用于让文字逐字符循环变换颜色并动画的标题点缀组件。",
  "category": "effect",
  "tags": [
    "css",
    "tailwind",
    "aceternity-ui"
  ],
  "platforms": [
    "web"
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "text",
      "type": "string",
      "required": true,
      "description": "要渲染的文字，每个字符都会单独进行颜色和动效动画。",
      "default": "\"black\""
    },
    {
      "name": "colors",
      "type": "string[]",
      "required": false,
      "description": "文字使用的颜色列表。",
      "default": "() => [\r\n    \"rgb(131, 179, 32)\",\r\n    \"rgb(47, 195, 106)\",\r\n    \"rgb(42, 169, 210)\",\r\n    \"rgb(4, 112, 202)\",\r\n    \"rgb(107, 10, 255)\",\r\n    \"rgb(183, 0, 218)\",\r\n    \"rgb(218, 0, 171)\",\r\n    \"rgb(230, 64, 92)\",\r\n    \"rgb(232, 98, 63)\",\r\n    \"rgb(249, 129, 47)\",\r\n  ]"
    },
    {
      "name": "startColor",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "字符的初始颜色。",
      "default": "\"rgb(255,255,255)\""
    },
    {
      "name": "duration",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "动画持续时间（秒）。",
      "default": "0.5"
    }
  ],
  "events": [],
  "slots": [],
  "exposes": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "code": "<script setup lang=\"ts\">\r\nimport { Motion } from \"motion-v\";\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n<template>\r\n  <div class=\"relative flex h-screen w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-black\">\r\n    <Motion\r\n      as=\"img\"\r\n      src=\"https://assets.aceternity.com/linear-demo.webp\"\r\n      class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 size-full [mask-image:radial-gradient(circle,transparent,black_80%)] object-cover\"\r\n      :initial=\"{ opacity: 0 }\"\r\n      :while-in-view=\"{\r\n        opacity: 0.5,\r\n      }\"\r\n      :transition=\"{\r\n        duration: 1,\r\n      }\"\r\n    />\r\n    <div>\r\n      <h1\r\n        class=\"relative z-2 text-center font-sans text-2xl font-bold text-white md:text-5xl lg:text-7xl\"\r\n      >\r\n        The best <ColourfulText text=\"components\" />\r\n        <br />\r\n        you will ever find\r\n      </h1>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</template>\r\n",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web"
    }
  ],
  "related": [],
  "whenToUse": [
    "大标题中需要突出的关键词逐字符变色动画。",
    "需要自定义颜色列表（colors）循环播放的文字点缀。"
  ],
  "whenNotToUse": [
    "需要发光/光泽扫过的文字，改用 radiant-text。",
    "需要闪光粒子点缀的文字，改用 sparkles-text。",
    "整词循环切换而非变色，改用 flip-words。"
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "仅 web 端可用，依赖 motion-v。",
    "text 为必填，动画按单个字符独立进行。",
    "colors 默认提供 10 个 rgb 颜色；startColor 是字符初始色（默认白色）；duration 单位为秒（默认 0.5）。"
  ],
  "dependencies": [
    "motion-v"
  ],
  "install": {
    "cli": "npx reborn-ui@latest add colourful-text"
  },
